cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Analysis code for colorectal liver metastases with extrahepatic disease"
authors:
  - family-names: Mitsuhashi
    given-names: Toshiharu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9940-0570"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sankyoh/crlm-extrahepatic-analysis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study of colorectal liver metastases with extrahepatic disease.
  Includes Stata multiple imputation, propensity-score weighting, covariate balance
  assessment, and survival analyses; R restricted mean survival time analyses using
  the first imputed dataset; and historical Python code for averaging balance tables.
  Requires separately prepared private analysis datasets. Patient-level data and
  dataset preparation and cleaning code are not included. See the README for
  reproducibility checks and known limitations.
keywords:
  - colorectal liver metastases
  - extrahepatic disease
  - multiple imputation
  - propensity score weighting
  - survival analysis
  - restricted mean survival time
